@startuml SD-08 Approve Movement Request
title SD-08 Approve Movement Request

actor "Registration Staff" as Staff
participant "Registration App" as App
participant "Movement API" as API
participant "Movement Decision Service" as Service
database "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS
participant "Monitor App" as MonitorApp

Staff -> App: Approve movement request
App -> API: POST /assets/movement/approve
API -> Service: approve_asset_movement_request()
Service -> DB: Validate request and registration node
Service -> DB: Set request = approved
Service -> DB: Set asset flow_status = in_transit
DB --> Service: Commit success
Service --> API: Approved movement
API -> WS: Broadcast asset_movement_approved
WS -> App: Update pending request list
WS -> MonitorApp: Update asset movement status

@enduml